## SQ-CDB-01
@group A
@commands Boot; `logs/latest.log`
@pass No startup or server script error for `glow_calamari.js`, `veggies_items.js`, `vintage_items.js`, `minecraft/recipes.js`, `miners_delight/*.js`, `oceansdelight/recipes.js`; `[itemMerges]` count one higher
@fails
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject (?i)(glow_calamari|veggies_items|vintage_items|minecraft/recipes|miners_delight/\S+|oceansdelight/recipes)\.js.*(error|exception)
kjsreject (?i)(glow_calamari|veggies_items|vintage_items|minecraft/recipes|miners_delight/\S+|oceansdelight/recipes)\.js.*(error|exception)
shell grep -h "\[itemMerges\]" logs/kubejs/*.log logs/latest.log | head -3; true
look the [itemMerges] count is one higher than the previous run's (the calamari merge)
## SQ-CDB-02
@group A
@commands `/dumpall`; look up the four `#creativeengineering:sweeteners` tags and sugar recipes
@pass Cooking (pumpkin pie, a Fruits Delight jam) takes all five; drinks (`farmersdelight:cooking/hot_cocoa`, a Fruits Delight tea mix, a Create DD milkshake mix) sugar, powdered sugar, honey bottle; Brewin' keg recipes all but glycerol; Botania mana powder, a Pretty Pipes module, the fermented spider eye jar recipe sugar or powdered sugar; powdered sugar and the sugar cube plain sugar (RC-25)
@fails
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:sweeteners
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:sweeteners/brewing
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:sweeteners/drink
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:sweeteners/plain
> cdevtest rdetail farmersdelight:cooking/hot_cocoa
> cdevtest rdetail pumpkin_pie
